    {
      "name": "Report",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "name": "Summary",
          "source": "# Grinding credits in Gran Turismo 7\n\nWhich race pays the most for the time it takes? **Races** lists each race with its payout, bonus included, and the shortest and longest time a run takes in minutes. **Runs** records a run of each race at those times. Choose the race from the dropdown and enter the duration in minutes: the columns to the right work out the payout per minute and what a long grind adds up to.\n\n{% let best = MAX(Data!Runs[Payout per minute]) %}\nThe best run pays **{{ TEXT(best, \"#,##0\") }}** credits a minute, in {{ INDEX(Data!Runs[Race], MATCH(best, Data!Runs[Payout per minute], 0)) }}. At that rate 40 hours of racing pays **{{ TEXT(best * 40 * 60, \"#,##0\") }}** credits.\n\nThe races and payouts here are representative examples. Replace them with the ones you can run.\n"
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "name": "Payout over 40 hours",
          "rowCount": 8,
          "colCount": 6,
          "formats": [
            {
              "startRow": 1,
              "endRow": null,
              "startCol": 1,
              "endCol": null,
              "format": {
                "numberFormat": "#,##0"
              }
            }
          ],
          "conditionalFormats": [
            {
              "startRow": 1,
              "endRow": null,
              "startCol": 1,
              "endCol": null,
              "kind": "scale",
              "low": null,
              "high": "green"
            }
          ],
          "cells": [
            {
              "row": 0,
              "col": 0,
              "input": "=QUERY(Runs, \"select Race, sum(`Payout over 40 hours`) group by Race pivot Duration\")"
            }
          ]
        }
